==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|večerъ|lang=ru}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|wekʷsperos|lang=ru}}. Cognates include Ancient Greek {{term|sc=polytonic|ἕσπερος|tr=hesperos|lang=grc}}, Latin {{term|vesper|lang=la}}, Old Armenian {{term|գիշեր||sc=Armn|tr=gišer|lang=xcl}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Ru-вечер.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
'''вечер''' (véčer) {{m}}

# [[evening]]
# [[tonight]], this evening
#:Вечер обещает быть приятным. — Tonight is going to be a pleasant night.
# {{formal|lang=ru}} [[party]], [[social]] [[gathering]], [[soiree]]

